WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.976
This one is an invitation,

2
00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:03.846
not an open listing.

3
00:00:05.057 --> 00:00:06.947
Start with Harmattan Club,

4
00:00:07.164 --> 00:00:08.984
then Create

5
00:00:09.161 --> 00:00:10.911
event, RSVP event.

6
00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:13.530
Name it Members'

7
00:00:13.655 --> 00:00:15.842
Table: November.

8
00:00:15.842 --> 00:00:17.433
Keep it in person,

9
00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:19.534
then choose Intimate,

10
00:00:19.666 --> 00:00:20.776
Classy

11
00:00:20.936 --> 00:00:22.380
and Exclusive,

12
00:00:22.453 --> 00:00:23.988
with Afrobeats, R

13
00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:27.867
and B, and Jazz.

14
00:00:28.176 --> 00:00:29.887
The description tells guests

15
00:00:29.887 --> 00:00:32.685
that every RSVP is reviewed.

16
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:36.025
Step two:

17
00:00:36.238 --> 00:00:38.427
Saturday the seventh of November,

18
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.825
from seven until eleven at night,

19
00:00:40.965 --> 00:00:42.070
Lagos time.

20
00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:54.164
Step three:

21
00:00:54.419 --> 00:00:57.372
choose Harmattan Club and its address.

22
00:00:58.293 --> 00:01:00.466
Leave Hide address on,

23
00:01:00.548 --> 00:01:02.879
so the full location is shared

24
00:01:02.879 --> 00:01:04.669
only after a guest is going.

25
00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:09.759
Step four,

26
00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:10.811
the cover

27
00:01:11.221 --> 00:01:12.397
a dinner video,

28
00:01:12.409 --> 00:01:14.685
then three photos guests can

29
00:01:14.685 --> 00:01:15.948
swipe through underneath.

30
00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:35.477
Step five makes the invitation deliberate.

31
00:01:36.016 --> 00:01:38.734
Limit the guest list to forty.

32
00:01:39.239 --> 00:01:40.833
Keep extras off,

33
00:01:40.923 --> 00:01:42.445
start a waitlist,

34
00:01:42.551 --> 00:01:45.788
and approve each RSVP yourself.

35
00:01:46.931 --> 00:01:48.451
Turn on chip-ins,

36
00:01:48.544 --> 00:01:50.900
suggest five hundred naira,

37
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:53.643
and set one hundred as the minimum.

38
00:01:54.181 --> 00:01:55.965
It is still optional.

39
00:01:56.917 --> 00:01:58.947
Keep the guest list private,

40
00:01:59.046 --> 00:02:01.336
and hide how many spots are left.

41
00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:04.929
Choose Unlisted

42
00:02:05.021 --> 00:02:07.598
and leave the discovery feed off.

43
00:02:08.442 --> 00:02:09.410
Publish,

44
00:02:09.502 --> 00:02:11.543
then share the link directly

45
00:02:11.543 --> 00:02:13.153
with the people you want there.

46
00:02:14.372 --> 00:02:15.885
On the live page,

47
00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:18.043
the address and spots-left

48
00:02:18.043 --> 00:02:19.214
count stay hidden

49
00:02:19.357 --> 00:02:21.383
exactly right for a members' night.
